// ── Daily ingestion trend (last 7 days) ───────────────────────────────────
// Powers the sparkline chart with color thresholds (green/yellow/orange/red).
// Thresholds: <250GB green, 250+ yellow, 300+ orange, 350+ red
// Used by: logicapp-metrics.json → metrics.json blob
Usage
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| summarize DailyGB = round(sum(Quantity)/1024, 2) by Day=bin(TimeGenerated, 1d)
| sort by Day asc
